  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Updating Suriname`s capture fisheries legal framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop a review report analyzing the existing legal framework for capture fisheries, including recommendations for improvement of the legal framework and a description of areas to be regulated;
Carry out a participatory process with all stakeholders to provide input in and support the review and drafting process of legal instruments;
-	Review and update existing capture fisheries legislation, and develop legislation addressing: inland fisheries and sea fisheries, including, among others, co-management, MCS, by-catch management, protected species (e.g. in relation to CITES), enforcement and control.</narrative>
  </description>
